  "description": {
    "en": "Grapplesnake Soldier is a next-generation tour control polyester engineered around maximum tension maintenance and exceptionally long playability. Its seven-sided profile and micro-abrasive surface generate higher spin than Tour Sniper and Tour M8 while preserving a predictable launch angle. Soldier offers medium power, outstanding control and stability, and is designed to perform best when strung approximately 3 lb lower than a player's normal polyester tension.",

    "zh": "Grapplesnake Soldier 是一款新一代竞技控制型聚酯球线，以极高的保磅能力和超长的可打时间为核心设计目标。它采用七边形截面和微磨砂表面，在保持稳定发射角的同时提供比 Tour Sniper 与 Tour M8 更强的旋转表现。整体力量处于中等水平，控制、稳定性与耐久性均非常突出。官方建议比平时聚酯穿线磅数降低约 3 磅，以充分发挥其性能。"
  },

